      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "敵を追い払えても\r\n仲間を癒すことができないんじゃ……。",
        "official_en": "While the enemy poses no issue, I’m unable to help my own allies.",
        "real_en": "I can drive the enemy away, but I can't heal our wounded comrades..."
      },
      "review": {
